{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:86dced293cea1294","name":"Catch a Second Wind","source":{"id":"source:reference-86dced293cea1294","title":"Catch a Second Wind","revision":18474,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:11:09Z","sha256":"dc9960e4fd5516fa24b0ce6f39fdc417cbc898479bf988ed3841d4dbba6a0b4e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18474","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Catch%20a%20Second%20Wind&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-86dced293cea1294","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you are reduced to one-half your maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," or less, you can Catch a Second Wind as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". You can only Catch a Second Wind once per day. Only characters with Heroic Levels can Catch a Second Wind; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beasts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beasts"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," characters, objects, and devices cannot. This Action heals one-quarter of your full ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Point"}," total (rounded down) or a number of points equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," score, whichever is greater. You can Catch a Second Wind only once per day.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Certain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," may allow you to Catch a Second Wind more often, but never more than once in a single encounter. If you have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Extra Second Wind"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Extra_Second_Wind","referenceId":"reference:bde4a7e421990dc5"}," feat, you can Catch a Second Wind an additional time per day (but never more than once in a single encounter). A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," character that takes the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Extra Second Wind"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Extra_Second_Wind","referenceId":"reference:bde4a7e421990dc5"}," feat can Catch a Second Wind once per day.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Optional Rules"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Multiple Second Winds"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Instead of having one Second Wind per day, every heroic character can Catch a Second Wind a number of times per day equal to 1 + (Class Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},") + (",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," Modifier), with a minimum of 1. Any ability that would add an extra Second Wind (such as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Extra Second Wind"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Extra_Second_Wind","referenceId":"reference:bde4a7e421990dc5"}," feat or the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Tough as Nails"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tough_as_Nails"}]}," Talent) instead adds a number of Second Winds equal to this base number. As always, you can Catch a Second Wind no more than once in a single encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["The Edge of Exhaustion"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you have already used your Second Wind(s) for the day, you can catch another Second Wind by voluntarily moving -1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent"}," step down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"}," remains until you've had ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surgery"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surgery"}," performed on you or until you get eight consecutive, uninterrupted hours of rest.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
